<p> Maize     3,794   38.0 (44.5)     n/a    n/a   (n/a)    (n/a)</p>
<p> Soybeans    n/a    n/a  (n/a)     n/a    n/a   (n/a)    (n/a)</p>
<p> Sunflower 3,007   18.6 (18.7)     n/a    n/a   (n/a)    (n/a)</p>
